Source: tomos-display-manager
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TomOS contributors <maintainers@tomos.example>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, pkg-config, libgtk-4-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tomos-display-manager
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-4-1
Recommends: greetd
Description: Lightweight Rust display manager and GTK4 greetd greeter
 TDM discovers installed Wayland and X11 desktop sessions and provides
 a GTK4 greeter that delegates authentication to greetd and the host PAM
 configuration. It is experimental and does not configure or enable greetd.
